    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.pick\n\n### Description\n\nTwo new options:\r\n- `prompt_cursor_format` string (vertical, horizontal, full, etc.)\r\n- `prompt_prefix` string\r\n\r\nIt would be great to have these options, specially if per picker, because then someone might want to customize the prompt in certain pickers.",
