        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "As in code both prompt cursor and prefix are used in a single line without (hopefully) any other major consequences, I decided to go ahead and add `window.prompt_cursor` and `window.prompt_prefix` options. So this should now be available on latest `main`.\r\n\r\nThanks again for the suggestion!",
